rem Regression fixture for GitHub issue #667: INPUT verify lists must accept a
rem lone numeric literal or expression, a lone LEN=min,max, and a verify list
rem followed by further input items, not only string/hex-keyed options.
c=7
INPUT (0,err=*same)"Enter the number of the CD to open (empty to skip): ",pick:(c)
a=1
INPUT n:(4)
INPUT n:(a+1)
INPUT x$:(LEN=1,5)
INPUT x$:("end"=done),y$
INPUT n:(4),m
ENTER n:(4)
READ (1,ERR=done) a:(100),b$
done:
release
